cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fastCD in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "fastCD: fast Cayley–Dickson arithmetic over real and complex numbers and finite fields"
abstract: >-
  A C library and NumPy-compatible Python extension for multiplication in the
  Cayley–Dickson tower over the real numbers, the complex numbers, and
  odd-characteristic finite fields, including a quasilinear O(N log N)
  multiplication algorithm alongside the direct recursion and the
  Cariow–Cariowa algorithm.
authors:
  - family-names: Lemley
    given-names: Harrison
version: 1.3.1
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://git.tanuki-cd.com/algebraity/fastCD"
keywords:
  - Cayley-Dickson algebras
  - hypercomplex numbers
  - quaternions
  - octonions
  - sedenions
  - finite fields
  - fast multiplication
